{"time": 1772284481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1550801189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你可以叫，比格雪山)"}
{"time": 1772284487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "744382239", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "对你来说，这是一条熟悉又陌生的路，尽管你没有真正沿着这条路走过，但几乎村里每个人都和你们说过这条路上发生过的故事"}
{"time": 1772284491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1952180896", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那很比格了）"}
{"time": 1772284522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "190062015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "村子和山脚之间隔着一片说不上大的平原，一条清澈的溪流从山区顺地势而下，将平原大致二等分"}
{"time": 1772284578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2144856999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“home。sweet，home”"}
{"time": 1772284627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2112195928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来叫弗拉西亚山脉）"}
{"time": 1772284729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1828061005", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=B8778F7147D11A2E239323DD09D24412.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTTLvybxjWvL9wxF-OaBHnEk-nbhxjg-AQg_woor7PDjaP8kgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQFiLXWTw6ZSc-bBUyYrYTq3oCjKWCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMELYFaV4e8oydVY00iAPgwAVCUIpr2jnpwt5zqIpObtFOhfpDPKEHGe8QriQvoTDtg,file_size=80992]"}
{"time": 1772284844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "67073103", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "银白的雪峰巍峨遥远。被波凯村村民称为“圣山”的主峰不过是弗拉西亚山脉的门面。追溯至寒风去往更北部的话，将是真正的银白色的世界"}
{"time": 1772284850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1682748922", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "此时正值夏季，平原上几乎可以说是生机勃勃，老树抽芽，不少草食动物在此觅食和带崽，偶尔也能遇到一些白速龙之类的小型肉食动物，但在食物充足的季节里，种间竞争还没有激烈到见面就要发起狩猎的程度，所以大多是互相保持着距离"}
{"time": 1772284900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "730239049", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，场景描写这一块的）"}
{"time": 1772285031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "495140428", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你沿着河流一路向前，路上偶尔有一些小型肉食动物朝你呲牙，不过也没有进一步的动作。也难怪，毕竟这里是猎人们的必经之路，敢蹬鼻子上脸的大概都被顺手做掉了"}
{"time": 1772285119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "901522006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（没有花丛吗）"}
