{"time": 1772415758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1740794681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "雪山的天黑的很早，晚上七点便已几乎算得上是深夜，原本这时候不太有人愿意出门受冻，但今天是个另外"}
{"time": 1772415794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "116602081", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(huh?)"}
{"time": 1772415867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1768000177", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "村中心的广场上篝火冲天，照亮了街坊间挂着的彩旗。闲的下来的村民们都走上街头，手里至少握着一块肉排，或者一杯啤酒"}
{"time": 1772416004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1614507795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#背上背个野猪王的獠牙显摆.jpg"}
{"time": 1772416020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2099524408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "原本傍晚就会收摊的小吃摊今天无一打烊，这座常年被风雪包裹的村落，燃烧起来的热情倒是一点不比热砂上的村落差——尽管你还没去过"}
{"time": 1772416268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1754182842", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1614507795]“塔莉娅！”你听见路边有人吆喝，是村里卖烤串店里的姐姐，她手里拿着两串刚从架子上拿下来的肉串对你挥挥“来来，这个拿着吃~”"}
{"time": 1772416285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1731172985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“谢谢姐姐～”"}
{"time": 1772416296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1083502436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#屁颠屁颠跑过去"}
{"time": 1772416316, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1947393660", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我有没有说过猎人的社会地位相当高.jpg）"}
{"time": 1772416406, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1131833405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(有吗)"}
{"time": 1772416447, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1699740613", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(但不妨碍一个刚成为猎人的少女心理仍然认为自己是个孩子.jpg)"}
{"time": 1772416449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1263224288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "周围围着的人自然也有老练的猎人……还有商会的收藏家，自然一眼认出你背着的东西。有人问你愿不愿意出手"}
{"time": 1772416473, "type": "recv", "message_id": "156093139", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我看你背景写的不是挺高冷的.jpg）"}
{"time": 1772416482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "549475758", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“当然是准备自用啊”"}
{"time": 1772416504, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1644559304", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(其实是阳光中带着一丝疏离)"}
{"time": 1772416520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "259188263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(今天开心所以非常阳光)"}
{"time": 1772416563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1788640980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "那么总之"}
{"time": 1772416563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "987109786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“第一次打到的猎物可要好好珍惜呢”"}
{"time": 1772416642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2138491937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "庆典的内容其实相当松散随意，没什么固定的流程，一群人载歌，一群人载舞。大家都和自己平日里的伙伴把酒言欢……这是刚开始的时候。等大家都开始有些醉了，酒肉就不再以桌为界限转移了。大家开始唱跑调的歌，和陌生人碰杯，比谁能最快消灭一斤浇了一层辣椒的波波肉。你作为今晚的主角之一，倒是享受了一把走到哪里都会被人自动塞满双手的待遇。最后村长带着人拉着烤全猪的大炉子出来，趁大家还没喝到桌子底下去的时候把你们四个叫到了一起"}
{"time": 1772416703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "206414020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#爽吃"}
{"time": 1772416717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1934231719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“嗯....嗯?”"}
{"time": 1772416878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1989975746", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“猎人们，今年，我们村子又多了四名令人欣喜的后辈。他们和我们每个人年轻的时候一样机敏而充满活力。在雪山脚下，我们的村子，也将一直充满活力。为生命干杯！”尽管已经年迈，但村长婆婆的口齿依旧清晰"}
{"time": 1772416888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "900385122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "台下的猎人们则齐刷刷地举起酒杯，呼应着村长“为生命干杯！”"}
{"time": 1772416892, "type": "recv", "message_id": "786982023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#干杯"}
{"time": 1772416902, "type": "recv", "message_id": "947091996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“为生命干杯！”"}
{"time": 1772416909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "438176052", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哦，好像没说）"}
{"time": 1772416932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1730499380", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“为生命干杯！”"}
