{"time": 1772466591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "997934916", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“说是什么隔壁村来的，我想找您求证，见没见过她。”#描述外贸"}
{"time": 1772466607, "type": "recv", "message_id": "683748185", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“说是什么隔壁龙人村来的，我想找您求证，见没见过她。”#描述外贸"}
{"time": 1772466720, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1580862654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“看我的眼神，却有些说不明的敌意”"}
{"time": 1772466751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "389249272", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“我的直觉告诉我没那么简单。”"}
{"time": 1772466783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "641323863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“龙人村啊……”村长搓了搓手“虽然也有和我一样，和人类相处非常密切的龙人。不过大部分龙人都会选择扎堆隐居。就连我也不知道最近的龙人聚落到底在哪”"}
