{"time": 1772468400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1717307072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "宿舍内一共就两人一猫，除安以外的另一人是个肤色偏暗的外地人，此时正窝在床上看着书"}
{"time": 1772468463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1174301181", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"在看书。\"指了指自己的座位，\"明天要坐气球去考察。\"转身倒一杯热水递给塔莉娅"}
{"time": 1772468474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "821888650", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#发觉无人入眠，停止潜行"}
{"time": 1772468497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "457998632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“看来你还挺惬意”"}
{"time": 1772468506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1659309443", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#接过喝一点"}
{"time": 1772468530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "528219534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“恭喜你获得了学者证！”"}
{"time": 1772468546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2042065662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "安的艾露猫也是通体雪白，不过要更毛绒绒一点，一看就很暖和"}
{"time": 1772468551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "812032798", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“不过之后打算现在学者这里实习吗?”"}
