{"time": 1772469064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "40608114", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（以后你会知道哪里劲爆的）"}
{"time": 1772469073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1643850339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(何意味)"}
{"time": 1772469088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1633699980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“嘛，看你在这里舒服就好”"}
{"time": 1772469105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1737634902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“看来学者的生活比我想的更好”"}
{"time": 1772469111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1949442725", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“搞得我也想考个看看了”"}
{"time": 1772469149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "614426148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“尽管我，理论方面有些笨手笨脚吧”"}
{"time": 1772469163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1089875825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“不过技多不压身。”"}
{"time": 1772469180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1038262827", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#摆了摆手也是自己坐到桌上"}
{"time": 1772469195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1962436167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（凳子：so？）"}
{"time": 1772469203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "231928234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔，毕竟不用做什么，也不用出去和怪物搏杀。\"顺着塔利娅的意思，微微弯了弯腰，挪挪位置，右手撩了撩头发，\"我天生就没什么力气啦...做猎人还是太难了。有时候也很羡慕你们。\""}
{"time": 1772469216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2040231822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#坐一起"}
{"time": 1772469243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1084971879", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔，虽然舒坦但是免不了无聊哦?真的想试试?\"挂着笑容，\"塔利娅的话，三天就忍不住了吧？\""}
{"time": 1772469256, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1695241788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“有你陪的话，难说。”"}
